    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22164" root="شرف" body-key="$">
    
      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْيَفْتُ الزَّرْعَ</span></b>  <i>I cut off the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرْيَاف</span>
[q. v.] <i>of the seed-produce;</i> (S, O;) and so
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْنَفْتُهُ</span>: (O and K * in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شرنف</span>:) of the dial. of
El-Yemen: but Az doubts whether the word be
with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span>; and the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> are both held by him
to be augmentative. (O.)

